Description: context menu items to open 1C:Enterprise file infobases
 Adds "Open with" items for 1Cv8.1CD files to the file manager context
 menu (Dolphin, Nautilus, etc.) to start 1C:Enterprise 8.3 / 8.5 in
 Designer and Enterprise modes via the 1cestart launcher.
